WEBVTT

00:03:57.141 --> 00:04:01.086
uning Kolumbiya konservativ hukumatiga 
qarshi isyonlar haqidagi hikoyalari

00:04:01.086 --> 00:04:04.893
Markesning sotsialistik 
qarashlarini shakllantirdi.

00:04:04.893 --> 00:04:09.753
Buvisi Donya Trankilina Iguaran Koutsning 
sehr-joduga bo'lgan munosabati

00:04:09.753 --> 00:04:13.748
"Yolg'izlikning yuz yili" uslubining 
asosiga aylandi.

00:04:13.748 --> 00:04:17.155
Makondo shahrini yaratishda 
muallif bolaligi o'tgan Arakatakadagi

00:04:17.155 --> 00:04:20.610
kichkina uylaridan ilhomlanadi.

00:04:20.610 --> 00:04:22.708
"Yolg'izlikning yuz yili" ni 
yozish asnosida

00:04:22.708 --> 00:04:25.081
Markes Lotin Amerikasining 
noyob tarixini

00:04:25.081 --> 00:04:28.154
hikoya qilishning 
o'ziga xos usulini topdi. U o'tmish

00:04:28.154 --> 00:04:33.142
fojialarini qayta boshdan kechirishga
mahkum mustamlakachilikdan keyingi davr